<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>RoHS Declaration</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #000;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .header-logo {
    float: right;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 50px;
    left: 60px;
    right: 60px;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    Power and productivity
    <span class="header-logo">ABB</span>
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center;">RoHS Declaration of Conformity</h1>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">RoHS Konformitätserklärung</h2>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">RoHS Déclaration de conformité</h2>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">RoHS Dichiarazione di conformità</h2>

  <p>This declaration of conformity is issued under the sole responsibility of the manufacturer.</p>
  <p>Die alleinige Verantwortung für die Ausstellung dieser Konformitätserklärung trägt der Hersteller.</p>
  <p>La présente déclaration de conformité est établie sous la seule responsabilité du fabricant.</p>
  <p>La presente dichiarazione di conformità è rilasciata sotto la responsabilità esclusiva del fabbricante.</p>

  <p>ABB SpA – <span data-field="location.name">{{ location.name }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="location.address_line_1">{{ location.address_line_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="location.city">{{ location.city }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="location.country">{{ location.country }}</span></p>

  <div class="section-title">Object of declaration</div>
  <p>Gegenstand der Erklärung / Objet de la déclaration / Oggetto della dichiarazione</p>

  <div class="section-title">ISOLTESTER-DIG-RZ; ISOLTESTER-DIG-RS; ISOLTESTER-DIG-PLUS; SELVTESTER-24 and QSD-DIG 230/24</div>
  <p>Insulation monitoring device for medical location</p>
  <p>Contrôleur d'isolement pour l'emplacement médicaux</p>
  <p>Monitor di isolamento per locali ad uso medico</p>

  <p>Manufactured after / Hergestellt nach / Fabriqués après / Prodotto dopo <span data-field="date_of_manufacture">{{ date_of_manufacture }}</span></p>

  <p>The object of the declaration described above is in conformity with</p>
  <p>Der oben beschriebene Gegenstand der Erklärung erfüllt die einschlägigen / L'objet de la déclaration décrit ci-dessus est conforme à / L'oggetto della dichiarazione di cui sopra è conforme alla</p>

  <p>DIRECTIVE 2011/65/EU OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL on the restriction of the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment (recast) listed in Annex II, 8 June 2011 as amended.</p>

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    Power and productivity
    <span class="header-logo">ABB</span>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Quality & Operational Excellence</p>
    <p>Tommaso Abbattista</p>
    <div style="height: 50px; width: 200px; margin: 0 auto;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    Declaration No: <span data-field="declaration_number">{{ declaration_number }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>